		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour Julien,</p><p>Par exemple, celui-ci : le couple 72308647+0003, s&#039;intercale entre deux occurrences du couple 72308647+0001.<br />00212&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0001&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 72308647&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2016-12-19&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 091418&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 091727&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0.052500&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 27<br />00217&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0003&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 72308647&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2016-12-19&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 105714&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 105758&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0.012222&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 27<br />00212&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0001&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 72308647&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2016-12-19&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 110935&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 110948&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0.003611&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0</p><p>Ou encore, celui-là : le couple 04648240+0011, s&#039;intercale deux fois, entre deux occurrences du couple 04648240+0010.<br />00206&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0010&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 04648240&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2017-01-10&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 152749&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 153236&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0.079722&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 32<br />00206&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0011&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 04648240&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2017-01-10&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 153236&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 153421&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0.029167&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 32<br />00206&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0011&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 04648240&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2017-01-10&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 153755&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 154248&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0.081389&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0<br />00211&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0010&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 04648240&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 2017-01-11&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 073208&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 073302&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 0.015000&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 32</p><p>J&#039;espère que c&#039;est plus clair. Pas toujours facile d&#039;énoncer un problème, désolé.</p>]]></content>
